<title>USA: Latin Amer Casinos to expand operations.</title>
<headline>Latin Amer Casinos to expand operations.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latin American Casinos Inc said Wednesday it plans to expand operations in Nicaragua by year end.</p>
<p>The company reported assets of more than $9 million, and has 3.3 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>Latin American Casinos is slot machine rental and remanufacturing company.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
